{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the impact of using the imagenet_vit_l image encoder in a multiprofile multimodal setup, replacing the resnet50 encoder from config_018 while maintaining avgpool aggregation and concat fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.6287 is slightly higher than the prior resnet50-based result (0.6186), suggesting the image encoder choice may contribute to performance. However, the exact contribution of the encoder versus multiprofile settings remains uncertain due to overlapping factors."
}

